Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.39,0:00:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So it really wasn't a dream...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Master! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we should do\Nyour master registration!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.39,0:00:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just stick your finger in my va—\N- Not right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we need to get you some\Nproper clothes and underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.15,0:00:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not be wearing underwear,\Nbut I am wearing clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you look like a cosplayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But with that said...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything for you to wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.45,0:00:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's still early.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.12,0:00:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm going to hit the convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're heading out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.46,0:00:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll go with you!\N- Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.71,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just go out commando!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.71,0:00:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But... l've been here by\Nmyself since I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.71,0:00:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so... lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.43,0:01:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you tired, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.39,0:01:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me master when we're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.19,0:01:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What a gust of wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite windy today, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.78,0:01:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No I'm {\i1}not{\i0} okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, the convenience\Nstore's right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.50,0:01:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.45,0:01:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.58,0:01:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we've bought them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.62,0:01:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's get those panties\Non her and head home.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Blocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said! Making eye contact is\Na not signal to kiss me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.09,0:01:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.51,0:01:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get changed in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.39,0:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure! I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm assuming she at least\Nknows her way around a restroom.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.31,0:01:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is she still in there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.07,0:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.07,0:01:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.62,0:02:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.45,0:02:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(1084,44)}{\c&H292B2B&\3c&HCCCADB&\shad0}BEWARE OF\NPERVERTS!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.66,0:02:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do your master registration here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.87,0:02:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.29,0:02:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you do it, I cannot move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!\NBut first, put on those underpants!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please put them on me, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.98,0:02:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.27,0:02:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,start by lifting your right leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.11,0:02:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be able to serve you\Nas soon as possible, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.03,0:02:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There are functions I\Ncannot currently access.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot satisfy you in this state, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Make me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.09,0:02:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Make me yours and yours alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.46,0:02:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Excuse meeeee!\N- Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I'll be right out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:03:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8} Brought to you by [ToonsHub]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.47,0:03:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I nearly got caught up in\Nthe heat of the moment..{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.31,0:03:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I am really looking forward to have you take\Noff the underwear you got for me, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.15,0:03:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.70,0:03:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.45,0:03:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Having someone else around...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.36,0:03:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't all that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, what did you just—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It was nothing! Just forget it!\NWhy are you so fast?!
